    "text": "By John Howley ,\n14 hours ago CIRCLEVILLE — Westfall had an early 3-2 lead, but Circleville quickly got out in front and kept the Mustangs in check on the way to a 69-37 win Tuesday in Day 2 of the Brad Morris Holiday Classic. A three from Reese Baughman had the Mustangs up 3-2 early... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
